<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to Fileam!</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; }
        html, body { width: 100%; margin: 0; padding: 0; overflow-x: hidden; -webkit-text-size-adjust: 100%; }
        body {
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif;
            line-height: 1.6;
            color: #333;
            max-width: 600px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 20px;
            background-color: #f5f5f5;
        }
        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 0;
            border-radius: 16px;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 12px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        @media only screen and (max-width: 600px) {
            body { padding: 12px !important; }
            .header, .content, .footer { padding: 24px 16px !important; }
            .cta-button { display: block !important; width: 100% !important; max-width: 280px !important; margin: 10px auto !important; }
        }
        .header {
            text-align: center;
            background-color: #ffffff;
            padding: 40px 30px;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #e9ecef;
        }
        .logo {
            display: block;
            margin: 0 auto 16px;
            max-height: 48px;
            width: auto;
        }
        .title {
            font-size: 22px;
            color: #008b8b;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .content { padding: 40px 30px; }
        .welcome-message {
            background-color: #e6f7f7;
            border: 1px solid #008b8b;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            text-align: center;
        }
        .welcome-text {
            color: #004d4d;
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .message { font-size: 15px; color: #4a4a4a; margin-bottom: 20px; line-height: 1.65; }
        .features { margin: 30px 0; }
        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            margin: 15px 0;
            padding: 16px;
            background-color: #f8fafc;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid #008b8b;
        }
        .feature-icon {
            width: 24px;
            height: 24px;
            background-color: #008b8b;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin-right: 15px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-size: 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }
        .feature-text {
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        .cta-section { text-align: center; margin: 30px 0; }
        .cta-button {
            display: inline-block;
            background-color: #008b8b;
            color: white !important;
            padding: 14px 32px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        .footer {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 0;
            padding: 28px 30px;
            border-top: 1px solid #e5e7eb;
            background-color: #f8f9fa;
            color: #6b7280;
            font-size: 14px;
        }
        .social-links { margin: 20px 0; }
        .social-link {
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 0 12px;
            color: #008b8b;
            text-decoration: none;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="header">
            <img src="https://usc1.contabostorage.com/385b0054b385440e928060e34f0e5b18:fileam-assets/fileam-logo.png" alt="Fileam" class="logo" width="140" height="48">
            <div class="title">Welcome to Fileam!</div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="content">
        <div class="welcome-message">
            <p class="welcome-text">Congratulations, <strong>{{name}}</strong>! Your account has been successfully verified.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
            <p>Welcome to Fileam! We're excited to have you on board. Your account is now fully activated and ready to use.</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="features">
            <h3 style="color: #1a1a1a; margin-bottom: 20px;">What you can do now:</h3>
            
            <div class="feature-item">
                <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
                <div class="feature-text">Access your personalized dashboard</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-item">
                <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
                <div class="feature-text">Manage your profile and preferences</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-item">
                <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
                <div class="feature-text">Explore our services and features</div>
            </div>
            
            <div class="feature-item">
                <div class="feature-icon">✓</div>
                <div class="feature-text">Connect with our support team</div>
            </div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="cta-section">
            <a href="https://fileam.app" class="cta-button">Get Started Now</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="message">
            <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, don't hesitate to reach out to our support team. We're here to help you make the most of your Fileam experience!</p>
        </div>
        
        <div class="social-links">
            <a href="https://fileam.app/help" class="social-link">Help Center</a>
            <a href="https://fileam.app/support" class="social-link">Contact Support</a>
            <a href="https://fileam.app" class="social-link">Visit fileam.app</a>
        </div>
        
        <div class="footer">
            <p>Thank you for choosing Fileam!</p>
            <p>&copy; Fileam. All rights reserved. <a href="https://fileam.app" style="color: #008b8b;">fileam.app</a></p>
        </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
